        "y1": 1559
      },
      "text": "\"I can only say after reading from first to last its more than 700 pages that I have never encountered anything this side of Gibbon's 'Rome' which has made me feel more the personal power of a single work.\"",
      "status": "ok",
      "confidence": 0.40056243538856506,
